# proc (D79): /proc, a directory for each process under the launcher's
# job (every service and what each starts), with their notes (D87), the
# kernel's trace at /proc/trace (D102), and how busy the CPUs are at
# /proc/cpu (D114). Manifests mount its tree at /proc.
service proc
program proc
export
jobs
tracing
info
restart on-failure
